r><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136224048,imgsize-130452.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[London's 1814 Beer Flood: Brewery disaster killed eight in bizarre tragedy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136215036.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On October 17, 1814, a catastrophic explosion at the Horse Shoe Brewery in London unleashed tons of beer onto the streets, tragically claiming the lives of eight individuals, including many women and children. Rescuers faced an arduous task as they navigated the wreckage to reach survivors trapped amid the ruins.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-1814-a-brewery-vat-burst-and-sent-a-wave-of-beer-through-london-streets-eight-people-died-in-one-of-historys-strangest-industrial-disasters/articleshow/136215036.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/in-1814-a-brewery-vat-burst-and-sent-a-wave-of-beer-through-london-streets-eight-people-died-in-one-of-historys-strangest-industrial-disasters/articleshow/136215036.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-27T20:01:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136215186,imgsize-991474.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Norse Atlantic risks losing all 12 Dreamliners as funding crisis threatens bankruptcy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136222700.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Norse Atlantic Airways finds itself in dire straits, grappling with severe financial challenges stemming from lease terminations for its Boeing 787 fleet. After halting all operations on November 26 due to a precarious cash position, the airline is now on the brink of bankruptcy. Amidst disputes over lease validity and the pursuit of emergency funding, its stock has plummeted, leaving its future operations hanging in the balance.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/norse-atlantic-faces-termination-of-leases-for-all-12-boeing-787s-as-cash-strapped-airline-seeks-emergency-funding-flights-are-suspended-bankruptcy-remains-a-risk-and-it-disputes-the-lessors-move/articleshow/136222700.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/norse-atlantic-faces-termination-of-leases-for-all-12-boeing-787s-as-cash-strapped-airline-seeks-emergency-funding-flights-are-suspended-bankruptcy-remains-a-risk-and-it-disputes-the-lessors-move/articleshow/136222700.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-27T18:30:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136223259,imgsize-965099.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[BC court rejects couple's claim to a lakeside access road under a 1997 agreement]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136222220.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jeno and Luminita Fabian attempted to assert access rights to their property by using a road on a developer's land. However, the Supreme Court of British Columbia ruled against them regarding the easement agreement from 1997. The court determined that the disputed road section was not covered under that easement. Their alternative request for a statutory easement was also rejected under property law.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-canadian-couple-said-a-1997-access-agreement-let-them-drive-past-their-lakeside-house-over-a-developers-land-but-an-alleged-46-square-metre-encroachment-led-to-a-fight-a-bc-court-rejected-their-claim-to-that-route/articleshow/136222220.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-canadian-couple-said-a-1997-access-agreement-let-them-drive-past-their-lakeside-house-over-a-developers-land-but-an-alleged-46-square-metre-encroachment-led-to-a-fight-a-bc-court-rejected-their-claim-to-that-route/articleshow/136222220.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-27T18:04:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136222639,imgsize-2272096.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Frugal Indianapolis man secretly leaves $13 million to charity]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136222654.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indianapolis-man-who-drove-an-old-car-refused-to-own-a-cellphone-and-lived-modestly-for-decades-secretly-amassed-13-million-and-left-it-to-12-local-charities-after-his-death/articleshow/136222654.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indianapolis-man-who-drove-an-old-car-refused-to-own-a-cellphone-and-lived-modestly-for-decades-secretly-amassed-13-million-and-left-it-to-12-local-charities-after-his-death/articleshow/136222654.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-27T18:11:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136222857,imgsize-1089726.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[74-year-old man with Alzheimer’s survives 11 days lost in Amazon rainforest]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136154465.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/